{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an accident, you awaken in a strange world. This is the limbo between consciousness and nothingness; a mindscape where past, present, and future intertwine. Here, the loved ones you\u2019ve forgotten are but whispers, while your suppressed hatred and deepest fears take shape as living nightmares. Among these fractured memories, you must find your path and reshape your past. Before you wake\u2026 will there be a story left worth remembering?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Veilborn</i> blends its atmospheric narrative with fluid and dynamic gameplay. Set within the mind of a comatose patient, you\u2019ll progress through chapters each presenting unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE:</strong> Discover surreal worlds, each with its own theme, filled with fragmented memories and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT &amp; SOLVE:</strong> Confront enemies that embody your traumas, or use your wits to unravel cleverly designed environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUMP &amp; ESCAPE:</strong> Overcome challenging platforming sequences with precise controls, and escape the most dangerous corners of your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHAPE:</strong> Through meaningful choices, influence the flow of the story and redefine your relationship with your past.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966710?t=1761384177","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966710/6fd8bc678870ebaf0d94a477c1043782ff4aa7cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761384177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966710/72922df0282718f6c72548f90f21c1515fa30a13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761384177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c